# Jepsen run output: histories, fressian test files, plots. The
# committed evidence is the named green/found logs under runs/
# (first-green, second-consecutive, http-first/second, the widened
# schedules, the elle lanes, the relaxed lane matrix, compare-657,
# poweroff, bolt-post-refactor); per-run timestamped logs stay local.
# Any committed evidence log over 1,000 lines rides gzipped
# (<name>.log.gz, gzip -9 — no raw .log over the 1k-line file rule);
# read them with `gunzip -c <name>.log.gz`. Evidence artifacts are the
# explicit exception to the 1k-line rule by decision: committed run
# evidence is the certification record (docs/testing/jepsen.md), and
# bulk transcripts ride gzipped.
store/
runs/2*.log
runs/http-2*.log
.cpcache/
.nrepl-port
# The control container's Clojure compile residue (bind-mounted repo).
classes/
